      "comment": "FOUR LEAF CLOVER (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 300m behind Outplayed (16.91) in a Grade 5. Tough to beat if on-song. TRUE AGENT (3) finished in the minors last start over the 300m at this track but ran a solid 16.57 last start. Top win latest and can measure up again. TUTA MOMENT (2) turned in a solid run last start over 300m at this track finishing 5th and beaten only 4 lengths (16.86). Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Should be about the money. KAKEGURUI (8) recorded the slickest time on the program at his latest win. Hard to beat again.",
